<PaperLayout
  title="Where Do Multilingual Vision-Language Encoders Fail on Low-Resource Languages?"
  venue="EMNLP 2026 · Main Conference"
  authors={authors}
  links={links}
  description="We falsify the linear-bias account and localise the low-resource retrieval gap to the EOS hidden state's forward-path trajectory. Swapping that single row three blocks before the projector lifts Swahili retrieval from 22.1% to 69.1%."
>
  <section>
    <figure>
